---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icons from '../components/Icons.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Dr. Ovide Decroly Wisnu Ardhi">
  <section class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800">Academic Profile</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mt-1 mb-2">
        Dr. Ovide Decroly Wisnu Ardhi, S.T., M.Eng.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Applied AI Researcher focusing on Bioenvironmental Informatics, Computer Vision, Deep Learning, Academic Writing, and Digital Education.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      
      <div class="p-6 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-1">Curriculum Vitae Resmi</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
            Lihat rekam jejak akademik lengkap, riwayat pendidikan, penelitian didanai, publikasi Scopus/Google Scholar, dan HKI.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/cv" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-md shadow-xs transition-colors shrink-0">
          <Icons name="download" class="w-4 h-4" />
          <span>Buka & Export PDF CV</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
        <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2">Tentang Ovide Academy</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Ovide Academy</strong> merupakan platform akademik dan repositori riset terbuka yang dirancang oleh <strong>Dr. Ovide Decroly Wisnu Ardhi, S.T., M.Eng.</strong> untuk membagikan catatan penelitian terapan, buku teks ilmiah, materi kuliah, dan pemikiran seputar kecerdasan buatan bagi kemaslahatan masyarakat.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 mb-4">
          Minat Riset & Fokus Keilmuan
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Fokus utama penelitian terapan mencakup integrasi kecerdasan buatan pada ranah bio-lingkungan, visi komputer, dan sistem pendidikan:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="p-3 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block text-xs">Bioenvironmental Informatics</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Penerapan AI & data sains untuk analisis citra biologis, pemantauan ekosistem, dan deteksi plankton mikroskopik.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block text-xs">Computer Vision & YOLO</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Arsitektur deteksi objek real-time, segmentasi semantik, dan inferensi neural network berkecepatan tinggi.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block text-xs">Applied Deep Learning</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Pengembangan model deep neural networks untuk sistem pendukung keputusan dan klasifikasi data ilmiah.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block text-xs">Academic Writing & Publication</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Metodologi penulisan karya ilmiah bereputasi, telaah literatur sistematis, dan publikasi internasional.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-2.5 sm:col-span-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block text-xs">Digital & Islamic Education</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Penguatan literasi digital, media pembelajaran interaktif, dan etika pemanfaatan AI dalam dakwah serta pendidikan.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 mb-4">
          Kontak & Tautan Akademik
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="https://github.com/ovidedecroly" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 flex items-center justify-between hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors">
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">GitHub Profile</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">github.com/ovidedecroly</div>
            </div>
            <Icons name="external" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-800" />
          </a>
          <a href="https://ovidedecroly.github.io" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-4 flex items-center justify-between hover:border-emerald-600 transition-colors">
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-xs text-slate-900">Academic Portal</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">ovidedecroly.github.io</div>
            </div>
            <Icons name="external" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-800" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
